  🍪 A cookie to set.

    🍪 response ⏳ 🆕🍪 🔤sid🔤 token❗️ 3600❗️❗️

  It starts with Path=/, HttpOnly and SameSite=Lax, and lasts until the
  browser closes unless ⏳ says how long. Every setter returns the cookie.
  The value can be any text: what a cookie may not hold is percent-encoded,
  and 🍪 r name❗️ decodes it when the browser sends it back.
